name net-jam-late-1
timeout 320

# THE CONTROLLER TAKEN AWAY MID-INTERCEPT — the failure mode O1's anchor calls the dangerous one, and
# the one the present stand-in (deleting him at spawn) cannot produce. doc/air-defence-network.md §6.
#
# The net is a RADIO link this time, not a cable: 21 km between two antennas on 8 m masts, which is
# 23.3 km of radio horizon by the 4/3-earth rule and therefore a link that works — and one that can be
# denied. The 2K12 is `emcon hold` and its fallback doctrine is `autonomy hold`: cut off from control,
# it waits for orders that never come.
#
# A second F-16 carries `set jam_comm_m 25000`. It is INAUDIBLE — it publishes no emitter signature at
# all, so nothing can bear on it and there is no home-on-jam — and it denies exactly one thing: the
# RECEIVER's link, on geometry, with no die and no ramp. Radar, RWR, IRST, the eye and every seeker are
# untouched, which is what `net-jam-wire.fbm` and the `site` lines here are the proof of.
#
# THE PAIR is this file against `net-jam-start.fbm`, where the jammer is already inside its own radius
# at t = 0. Blind against CONFIDENTLY blind: here the battery joins the net, is cued, comes up, gives
# its position away on the attacker's RWR — and is then cut off and may not shoot. There it never
# joins, is never cued, never radiates, and is never seen.
#
# WHAT TO READ:
#   events.log      `net JOIN` -> `net CUE` -> `site RADIATE` -> `net LOST reason=jammed` ->
#                   `net AUTONOMOUS fallback=hold`, and after it not one `site LAUNCH`
#   telemetry_sam.csv  net_state 1 (NETTED) -> 2 (SILENT), net_wcs 0 (free) -> 2 (hold), site_launches
#
# READING RULE: exit 0 = SUCCESS with the viper's waypoint reached is the pass. The MEASUREMENT is the
# time of `net LOST` and the launch count on either side of it.

net iads
  control ew
  link radio 60000 mast 8                       # [SET] 8 m masts: 23.3 km of horizon over a 21 km link
  period 4.0
  hold 3
  wcs free
  member ew
  member sam autonomy hold                      # cut off from control, this battery waits

unit viper
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.25000 6.90000 3000 0.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  wp 46.85000 6.90000 3000 450

unit jammer
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.30000 6.60000 6000 30.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 80
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr off
  set jam_comm_m 25000                          # [SET] one radius, one geometry, no J/S and no ramp
  wp 46.90000 6.95000 6000 450

unit ew
  module p18
  team hostile
  spawn 46.62000 7.10000 ground 0.0 0
  set emcon free

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.75000 6.90000 ground 0.0 0
  set emcon hold
  set rounds 3
